<!-- Process -->
<section class="section process-band" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center light">
      <h2>Our Process</h2>
      <span class="sep"><i></i></span>
    </div>
    <div class="process-tabs">
      <ul class="process-nav" id="processNav">
        <li class="active" data-tab="0">Meet &amp; Agree</li>
        <li data-tab="1">Idea &amp; Concept</li>
        <li data-tab="2">Design &amp; Create</li>
        <li data-tab="3">Build &amp; Install</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="process-panels" id="processPanels">
        <div class="panel active"><p>We start with a relaxed consultation to understand your space, budget and taste. You get a written brief and a clear fee proposal before anything begins — no surprises later.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><p>Mood boards, material samples and spatial sketches turn the brief into a direction. We refine two or three concepts with you until one feels unmistakably right.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><p>Detailed drawings, lighting plans, joinery and finish schedules are produced. We coordinate trades and suppliers so the build matches the drawings.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><p>On-site supervision through to snagging, furniture delivery and styling. We hand over a finished, photographed space ready to live or work in.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

